# EngageLab

> EngageLab is a world-leading omnichannel customer engagement platform operated by Aurora Mobile (NASDAQ: JG), founded with 13+ years of push notification and messaging infrastructure experience. The platform provides unified API access to 9 messaging and engagement products: AppPush, WebPush, Email, SMS, WhatsApp Business API, Marketing Automation, LiveDesk, OTP, and CAPTCHA. EngageLab serves 1/3 of the world's application end users, processes 10 billion+ messages per day at peak, and supports tens of billions of average daily access requests with 1 billion concurrent access requests at peak. SDKs are available for Android, iOS, Web, Flutter, React Native, Cordova, and uni-app. Transparent pricing with no hidden costs; DAU-based billing for push products and MEP-based billing for Marketing Automation.

EngageLab is built for developers integrating customer communication via API/SDK and for marketers running omnichannel campaigns. Key capabilities:

- **5 messaging channels** managed in one platform: AppPush, WebPush, Email, SMS, WhatsApp Business API
- **Marketing Automation**: drag-and-drop visual workflow builder, pre-built templates, AI-powered content creation, triggered messaging
- **LiveDesk**: omnichannel customer service platform unifying inbound conversations across channels
- **OTP**: one-time password verification with multi-channel fallback (SMS, WhatsApp, Voice, Email), anti-fraud detection, 99% delivery rate
- **CAPTCHA**: AI-driven bot detection for seamless and secure user verification
- **Analytics**: real-time revenue conversion tracking, user behavior analysis, complete message lifecycle logs

## Products — Messaging Channels

- [AppPush](https://www.engagelab.com/app-push): High-efficiency mobile app push notification service. Supports Android (FCM, Huawei, Xiaomi, OPPO, vivo, HONOR, MEIZU, EngageLab self-built channel) and iOS (APNs, EngageLab self-built channel). Features include smart push, push plans, frequency capping, end-user time zone push, message status callback, and push detection. 30-day free trial.
- [WebPush](https://www.engagelab.com/web-push): Real-time web push notification service. Covers Android, Windows, macOS, and iOS platforms across major browsers (Chrome, Safari, Firefox). Average daily message volume over 10 billion. Smart subscription prompts boost opt-in rates by up to 70%. 15-day free trial.
- [Email](https://www.engagelab.com/email): Email marketing campaign and transactional email service. 99% inbox placement rate via intelligent warm-up and A/B testing. AI-powered drag-and-drop editor with inbox preview across 100+ clients (Gmail, Outlook, Yahoo). Integration via SMTP or API (Python, Java, PHP, Ruby, Perl, C#, Go, Node.js). Average delivery time 3 seconds globally. 50 free emails per day.
- [SMS](https://www.engagelab.com/sms): Global SMS marketing platform with 98% average delivery rate. Supports marketing, transactional, and OTP messages. Special pricing available.
- [WhatsApp Business API](https://www.engagelab.com/whatsapp-business-api): Advanced WhatsApp Business API platform. Supports marketing campaigns, transactional notifications (order updates, shipping alerts), OTP verification, and customer service. Supports text, emoji, image (PNG/JPG/JPEG), and video messages. Claimed lowest price in the world.

## Products — Marketing & Support

- [Marketing Automation](https://www.engagelab.com/marketing-automation): All-in-one omnichannel automation platform. Visual drag-and-drop customer journey builder, pre-built workflow templates, AI-powered content creation, triggered messaging, and personalized campaign delivery. Billed by MEP (Monthly Engaged Persons).
- [LiveDesk](https://www.engagelab.com/livedesk): Omnichannel customer service platform. Unifies inbound conversations across messaging channels; supports unlimited support agents. New product.

## Products — Productivity & Security

- [OTP](https://www.engagelab.com/otp): One-time password verification service. Multi-channel delivery: SMS, WhatsApp, Voice, Email. Customizable OTP length, type, and validity period. Built-in anti-fraud detection covering SMS pumping and IRSF. 99% delivery rate. Channel fallback ensures continuity if primary channel fails.
- [CAPTCHA](https://www.engagelab.com/captcha): AI-driven CAPTCHA for bot detection and secure user verification. Advanced bot detection with seamless user experience. New product.

