- [Retail & Ecommerce](https://www.engagelab.com/ecommerce): Omnichannel marketing covering push, email, SMS, and WhatsApp for promotional campaigns, cart abandonment, loyalty programs, and fraud prevention. Shopify app available. 99% inbox placement, ~70% WebPush subscription increase, 10–30% reduction in email delivery costs.
