## Pricing

- [Pricing](https://www.engagelab.com/pricing): Fully transparent pricing with no hidden costs. AppPush and WebPush billed by DAU (Daily Active Users, maximum single-day count per month). Marketing Automation billed by MEP (Monthly Engaged Persons, unique users entering any journey per month). Email, SMS, WhatsApp billed by volume. Enterprise and custom plans available via sales@engagelab.com.

